      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clear_Creek%2C_Utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Because of the heavy winter snow and isolation, local amusements once consisted mainly of dances and winter sports.",
